A. Commit message:
Fix bone vertex index check in ASEParser for older version

B. Change summary:
Updated the older version of ASEParser.cpp to ensure that the correct container size is checked when validating bone vertex indices. This prevents out-of-bounds access and ensures proper logging of warnings.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Low

